  "summary": "My Professional and Project Portfolio: \nhttps://ericpilati.dunked.com/\n\nI am actively looking for new work in a software developer environment where I can grow and become a better developer than I already am.\n\nDedicated Software Developer with a strong educational foundation and over two years of professional experience in coding and programming. Specialized in C# and Razor, with a focus on building and maintaining complex web applications. Was the primary developer on a $150,000 project to establish a facility maintenance site for the San Diego Community College and now serving as the primary coder and creator of a high-value site application valued at $10,000.",
