    "description": "Provided exceptional customer service to clients with a domestic audience through analyzing, designing, developing, and maintaining codes such as: C#, Razor, SQL, JavaScript, and AJAX.\n• Create and upkeep website features while maintaining high page speed performance rates.\n• Identified bottlenecks and debugged code in alignment with clients, maintaining communication through regular meetings and email correspondence to improve their logistics and financial systems.\n• Create automated processes and policies via the N-central RMM (Remote Monitoring and Management) to automate, monitor, manage, and secure customer environments.\n• Developed company-wide process that saved over an hour a week on delegating tickets. Process included use of Regular Expression (regex) monitoring of alert emails, combined with the existing ticketing system, Autotask, and UDFs to automatically assign clients to associated tickets.\n• Established processes to ensure monitoring of maintenance and security updates, which included: configuration of client specified computer login and security specifications and the use of Azure and SentinelOne technologies.\n• Maintained, installed, and updated hardware including servers, lane beetles, screens, printers, cat 6, pin pads.",
